                                "sense_id": "7a749838-c880-3ab1-a887-706394abf3ae",
                                "text": "The terminology of clinographic curves is somewhat confusing. Strictly speaking, if the hypsographic curve shows the distribution of height of a given area, the clinographic curve should show the distribution of slope in a given area·"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1fe340c3-f80f-41fd-b48a-3f31f68b7103",
                                "sense_id": "7a749838-c880-3ab1-a887-706394abf3ae",
                                "text": "The clinographic curves reveal the breaks in slope and sudden changes in the relief of the area and they also present the general trend of the surface."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
